## 🗄️ Database Schema (Cloudflare D1)

### Tables
- `users` — player profiles, auth binding (device fingerprint/MAC)
- `games` — game records (mode, result, pgn, timestamps)
- `moves` — individual moves per game
- `tournaments` — tournament definitions
- `tournament_participants` — bracket assignments
- `challenges` — player-to-player challenge system
- `chat_messages` — in-game chat
- `achievements` — badge system
- `daily_content` — chess history/articles (auto-updated)
- `leaderboard` — computed stats view

---

## 🔌 API Routes (Cloudflare Workers)

| Method | Path | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| POST | /auth/register | Device fingerprint registration |
| POST | /auth/verify | Token refresh |
| GET | /profile/:id | Get player profile |
| PUT | /profile/:id | Update profile/avatar |
| POST | /game/create | Create new game record |
| POST | /game/move | Save move (server validation) |
| GET | /game/:id | Get game state |
| GET | /leaderboard | Top players |
| GET | /tournaments | List tournaments |
| POST | /tournaments/:id/join | Join tournament |
| GET | /content/daily | Daily chess content |
| WS | /multiplayer | WebSocket gateway |

